From fc9e74b4277eb59cda3363ccb2beae9f910c9965 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 06:41:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] plugin: Add extension payload builder support

Add support for plugin-specific construction of extension
payloads stored in the _EXTENSIONS transport object.

A new PluginFactory API allows plugins to transform
runtime metadata into the payload format associated with
an extension interface. Payload construction is exposed
through the PluginService integration layer and delegated
to the corresponding plugin implementation.

This keeps plugin-specific schema knowledge outside of
log_manager while allowing plugins to control their own
extension payload format.

Change-Id: I72f1fb440d43a2d24ef5d4b7a82432d9a0f6a3be
Signed-off-by: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
